w":"Rhiannon's plan to get over AJ and assert herself as a vigilante killer is thwarted in an unexpected way.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZB2Rtxn6USMTWOqYc1wfaiybpq.jpg","released":"2026-11-26T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"51 min"},{"id":"tt11218290:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"I've Been Doing This a Lot Longer Than You","overview":"Rhiannon tries to track down the copycat, but they seem just out of her reach.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7tl5wTo93jWTfSAPL7ltZSSdrMs.jpg","released":"2026-12-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"},{"id":"tt11218290:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Was I Always Weird?","overview":"When Rhiannon sets out to frame the copycat for her crimes, she finds herself entangled with them further.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/urF5wLrePedskkwdHzSErH6NCDI.jpg","released":"2026-12-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt11218290:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"No Mess, No Fuss","overview":"Pressure is mounting in the search for AJ, and Rhiannon accepts Gabriel's offer of help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/90qGn3rmzCt6X27pJnyNgMg8JMD.jpg","released":"2026-12-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"},{"id":"tt11218290:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Are You Up to Anything Dodgy?","overview":"Rhiannon is devastated to discover that recognition feels empty without the support and love of those closest to her - has she made a mistake?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5l3BOS7jEcBrlP8EiygqRiDflRF.jpg","released":"2026-12-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt11218290:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Nobody's Perfect","overview":"Rhiannon and Gabriel start their new life together - but is this what she wants?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/txtzf71zwWSUl4lSSpVtIgBVLlR.jpg","released":"2026-12-31T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"}]}}